{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vX0EZAAVzR1794873822.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>印尼東部馬魯古省外海發生6.6級地震，暫時未有傷亡報告。當局指這次地震不會引發海嘯。</p><p></p><p>地震發生於當地今早6時11分，即本港早上5時11分。美國地質調查局錄得強度為6.6級，本港天文台則錄得6.5級。震央位於馬魯古省安汶市東南外海約470公里，震源深度約10公里。澳洲北部有居民表示感受到震動。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T01:05:37.079061+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.386372+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T00:59:02.729491+00:00","content_hash":"a10922f6d09622881b2fca0ed39c2ee46155b333ac0327c8d0e09cb2a9acba97","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T01:05:37.079061+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}